A||||10||skitime||1 Year Aniversity for my T-Top ||||1||
Z||000000||skitime||12-27-2001||02:40 PM||||Today is one year since I bought my T-Top. I rode an overnight Greyhound to Auburn,IN. to get it from Chris Moore.  I drove it home through a lot of snow. I was afraid I would never make it with the tires that were on it. Well, it has been quite a year. It has had a complete body panels off paint job and added a custom chin spoiler and side Mecham side scoops.  Engine removed and detailed. I made a custom trunk lid which had to be painted to match. Bought new wheels and tires.  I even designed a installed a removable rear window. I entered several shows through the year and met a lot of great people. I think the greatest thing of having the Fiero is all the really neat people we got to know.  It is hard to believe it has been a year already.  Well, as most of you that know me, I can't seem to leave the car alone so this winter are several large projects which will really change the car some more.  I have made a custom hood, custom front fenders, and I am putting a new crate 3800 supercharged engine (With the help of TooManyFiero, TerryK, Jelly2M8 and lots of others)while converting the car from automatic to 5 speed Getrag.  Winter will seem short!  Here are some pics of before.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/T_Drivers_Side_View-1_1.JPG">  <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/T_left_rear_3-4_View-1.jpg"> <P>  Here are some later pics.<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P000817-1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P000821-1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P7080045-1_2.jpg">    <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-2.JPG">    <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||12-27-2001||04:28 PM||||Happy Aniversity Dave,   You have done soo much in one year to make one of the sweetest fieros going. Keep up the good work you should be proud  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||7
